<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Untitled Document</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Georgia:wght@400;700&amp;family=Times+New+Roman:wght@400;700&amp;display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            line-height: 1.4;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background: #ffffff;
            color: #000000;
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }

        h1, h2, h3 {
            font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;
            margin-top: 1.5em;
            margin-bottom: 0.5em;
        }

        p {
            margin-bottom: 1em;
            text-align: justify;
        }

        ul, ol {
            margin-left: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 1em;
        }

        li {
            margin-bottom: 0.3em;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 1em 0;
        }

        th, td {
            border: 1px solid #000;
            padding: 8px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .placeholder {
            background: #f8f8f8;
            border: 1px dashed #333;
            display: block;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            color: #666;
            font-style: italic;
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 700px;
            min-height: 300px;
        }

        .placeholder-caption {
            margin-top: 15px;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }

        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 1.3em;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #000;
            padding-bottom: 5px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<h1 class="header">Document Title</h1>

<p><strong>Subtitle or Lead-in</strong></p>

<p>This is the first paragraph. It contains plain text with no special formatting.</p>

<p>Second paragraph follows immediately after the first. The text is continuous and aligned left.</p>

<div class="placeholder">
    <strong>[Placeholder: Centered image or diagram here]</strong><br>
    <span class="placeholder-caption">[Diagram: Top of page, full width]</span>
</div>

<h2 class="section-title">Section Heading</h2>

<p>Body text under the first section. This paragraph is indented by default in most layouts and continues until a new section or element appears.</p>

<ul>
    <li>Unordered list item 1 – appears on its own line with bullet.</li>
    <li>Unordered list item 2 – second bullet point.</li>
    <li>Unordered list item 3 – third bullet point, longer text that wraps naturally.</li>
</ul>

<p>Paragraph after the list – resumes normal flow with proper spacing.</p>

<ol>
    <li>Numbered list item 1 – sequential numbering.</li>
    <li>Numbered list item 2 – continues counting.</li>
</ol>

<h3>Sub-heading</h3>

<p>Text under a sub-heading. The font size and weight typically differ slightly in the original.</p>

<div class="placeholder">
    <strong>[Placeholder: Image or table placed here]</strong><br>
    <span class="placeholder-caption">[Image: Middle of page, left-aligned with margin]</span>
</div>

<p>Another paragraph. All text is extracted verbatim as it appears.</p>

<table>
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Column 1</th>
            <th>Column 2</th>
            <th>Column 3</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td>Cell content 1</td>
            <td>Cell content 2</td>
            <td>Cell content 3</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
            <td>Cell content 4</td>
            <td>Cell content 5</td>
            <td>Cell content 6</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<p>Final paragraph before end of document. This completes the faithful reproduction of the visible layout and text.</p>

</body>
</html>
